1
00:00:00,170 --> 00:00:03,390
(Penny:)Hey. Isn't tomorrow
your usual laundry night?

2
00:00:03,390 --> 00:00:06,560
(Sheldon:)The supermarket was out of
my regular fabric softener.

3
00:00:06,560 --> 00:00:09,310
(Sheldon:)If this one under-
or over-softens,

4
00:00:09,320 --> 00:00:12,100
(Sheldon:)I'll need time
to make things right.

5
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:13,800
(Penny:)That's thinking ahead.

6
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:17,160
(Sheldon:)The alternative would be
to think backwards.

7
