(Penny:)Oh, no. Why?

12
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:30,950
(Sheldon:)I thought she was
a highly evolved creature

13
00:00:30,950 --> 00:00:33,060
(Sheldon:)of pure intellect, like me.

14
00:00:33,060 --> 00:00:34,870
(Sheldon:)But recent events indicate that

15
00:00:34,870 --> 00:00:37,340
