to her baser urges.

16
00:00:37,340 --> 00:00:39,360
(Sheldon:)Like you.

17
00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:43,230
(Penny:)Just going to
skip over that insult.

18
00:00:43,230 --> 00:00:45,680
(Sheldon:)What insult?

19
00:00:45,690 --> 00:00:48,770
(Penny:)Yeah. That's why
I'm going to skip over it.

20
00:00:48,770 --> 00:00:50,640
(Penny:)Are you saying that Amy is...

21
00:00:50,640 --> 00:00:53,640
(Penny:)oh, what's the
scientific word...

22
00:00:53,640 --> 00:00:56,410
(Sheldon:)Forget science. She's horny.

23
00:00:58,110 --> 00:01:00,400
(Penny:)Oh! Okay. Wow.

